# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MC4 Frontend – environment variables for deployment (AWS, Azure, etc.)
# Copy to .env.local for local overrides, or set in your host's env config.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Backend API base URL (optional).
# - Leave unset when the same server proxies /api to the backend (e.g. nginx or Vite proxy).
# - Set when the frontend runs on a different host than the API (e.g. S3 + API Gateway).
#   Example: https://your-api.execute-api.region.amazonaws.com
#   Example: https://your-backend.azurewebsites.net
# The app will send requests to this origin (e.g. https://your-api.../api/kpis/...).
# VITE_* is embedded at build time; rebuild after changing.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
